---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../config/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | YardCalc"
  description="YardCalc privacy policy: in-browser calculators, cookies, Google AdSense/GA4 disclosures, and ad opt-out links."
  canonicalPath="/privacy/"
>
  <Breadcrumbs items={[{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'Privacy' }]} />
  <article class="container prose panel" style="margin:1rem auto 3rem;max-width:800px">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="answer-first">
      YardCalc calculator inputs are processed in your browser and are not uploaded to our servers as part
      of the static site. This policy explains cookies, analytics, and advertising disclosures.
    </p>
    <p>Last updated {siteConfig.contentUpdated}</p>
    <h2>Information we process</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Calculator inputs:</strong> stay on your device unless you voluntarily share a URL that
        contains query parameters.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Contact email:</strong> if you email {siteConfig.contactEmail}, we receive the message
        contents you send.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Logs:</strong> hosting providers may log standard request metadata (IP, user agent) for
        security and reliability.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Cookies, analytics, and advertising</h2>
    <p>
      We may use Google Analytics 4 to understand aggregate traffic. Third-party vendors, including Google,
      may use cookies to serve ads based on a user’s prior visits to this or other websites when Google
      AdSense is enabled.
    </p>
    <p>
      Google’s use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads based on your visits to
      this site and/or other sites on the Internet. You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting
      <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" rel="noopener">Ads Settings</a>. Alternatively, you can
      opt out of some third-party vendors’ use of cookies for personalized advertising by visiting
      <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" rel="noopener">www.aboutads.info</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      Learn more about how Google uses data:
      <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener"
        >How Google uses information from sites or apps that use our services</a
      >.
    </p>
    <h2>DoubleClick / personalized ads</h2>
    <p>
      When AdSense is active, Google may use the DoubleClick cookie for ad serving and measurement. Use the
      opt-out links above to manage personalized ads. For visitors in the EEA, UK, and Switzerland, a Google
      certified CMP must obtain consent before personalized ads (see the repository file docs/ADSENSE.md).
    </p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Privacy questions: <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.contactEmail}`}>{siteConfig.contactEmail}</a></p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
